      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Destination Handover, Odometer Sign-Off &amp; Joint Condition Inspection for Car Transport From Pondicherry To Hyderabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><div style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 24px 0;"><h4 style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i>Important Logistics Advisory</h4><div style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;"><ul>
   <ul>
   <li>Verify the current odometer reading directly against the figure recorded on the LR bilty document. This numerical confirmation prevents mileage fraud and establishes accurate usage metrics for warranty or resale valuation.</li>
   <li>Inspect all exterior panels, windows, mirrors, and wheels under direct daylight, matching each visual detail to the baseline pickup photo archive. Note any environmental wear or transit-related defects on the delivery manifest.</li>
   <li>Execute a formal signed condition sign-off once verification is complete. Both the logistics agent and the vehicle owner must affix signatures, timestamps, and contact details to the handover certificate. This document serves as the final legal acknowledgment of receipt and closes the transportation liability chain.</li>
   </ul>
   <p>Proper execution of these verification steps protects all stakeholders from post-delivery disputes and ensures transparent chain-of-custody records. The daylight inspection eliminates shadow distortion, the odometer cross-check maintains mileage authenticity, and the signed condition sign-off provides enforceable proof of delivery. Logistics personnel must never bypass these requirements, as missing documentation voids insurance claims and complicates regulatory audits. Maintaining rigorous handover standards guarantees vehicle safety, customer satisfaction, and operational compliance across every automobile transport route.</div></div></div>
